<p>Summons your lust for blood and destruction; especially when the odds are against you.  </p><p>You increase your damage by 10% + <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">1.0%, 2.3%, 3.9%, 5.0%, 6.0%</acronym> per enemy you can see in line of sight of you (maximum 5 enemies, <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">15%, 22%, 29%, 35%, 40%</acronym> bonus) for 3 turns.</p><p>The damage bonus will increase with your Constitution.</p>